pe emir was  blamed for letting the pigs loose and to  be fair she was actually the one who did  it as we learned in chapter 135 of the  manga emir likely did this because she  herself felt just as imprisoned as those  pigs were and so if she couldn't escape  then she could at least give the pigs a  chance at freedom emir's punishment for  this act of defiance was to be hunted  for sport by the ldn soldiers as she ran  for her life from the cruel soldiers an  injured emir came across an unusually  massive tree there was an opening at the  bottom of the tree and emir tried to  hide inside it but when she entered the  opening she fell into some type of  sinkhole filled with liquid  just when it looked like emir was about  to drown alone in the darkness a strange  spine-like creature that resembles a  hallucigenia approached emir and then  attached itself to her spine in the next  moment emir and that strange creature  somehow fused and as soon as this  occurred emir transformed into the very  first titan her titan form was  absolutely gigantic and it easily  dwarfed even the colossal titans  this was the very first titan and this  titan embodied all nine titans shifter  powers that we know today within a  single person emir when he saw this  incredible power the king of elder  changed his mind about killing amir  instead of killing her he made her one  of his wives and used her to expand the  aldean empire that is how emir the slave  became emir fritz emir went along with  all of this and she served the king  loyally despite his cruelty thanks to  emir's titan form the aldians were able  to annihilate their enemies including  the ancient marlians and they were also  able to build the kind of large-scale  infrastructure that the other nations  could only dream of including massive  bridges across mountains huge roads and  other concrete structures and so thanks  to the power of emir's titan the eldian  empire became the dominant power on the  continent eventually emir 