d to join the ranks of her own  abusers and wreak havoc upon the world  killing millions of innocent people in  the process  and so rather than being a poorly  written victim character as i initially  thought she was she is actually a pretty  well written and pretty effed up villain  character  what do you guys think of emir fritz as  a character and do you agree with my  assessment that she was actually one of  the most messed up villains in attack on  titan don't forget to leave your  feedback down in the comments below if  you guys enjoyed this video and you want  to see more videos like it in the future  just leave a quick like it only takes a  second but it helps with that youtube  algorithm and if you're new to animal  pro or maybe you've been watching our  videos but you just haven't taken the  time to subscribe yet remember that  subscribing and hitting that  notification bell is a very real and  very important way of directly  supporting this channel you can also hit  me up on twitter and instagram at  animeopror i want to give a big thank  you to all of our anime uproar patrons  for making videos like this one possible  special thank you to kyle salisbury this  man is an absolute mad lad and a  disciple of lord to ego himself and i  can't forget all of our the one tier  patrons the ones who rise above all  other clans including alpha sigma in  grata algital pate heffa the red-haired  fox hinokami and water the toasted chi  cory mcgowan spidey left tanel tungsten  tarkis big buddhist and jeremy cummings  finally thank you also to our pro hero  tier patrons including the one and only  gilgamesh steelers angel cruz alicia  octor bonnie parks joy and garcia boy  games kaido might be a duck jessica  rabbit jeremy phillips and alivania if  you enjoy our videos and you feel that  they provide value for you consider  supporting us on patreon even a single  dollar will give you access to our  patron exclusive discord and your name  will appear in our videos along with  these amazing people as always thank you  guys so much for watching and until next  time see ya space cowboys  [Music]  you
 

